      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794406283,
      "updated": 1794406283
    },
    {
      "id": "6af477c10000000000f552c7",
      "text": "\t[👍いいね]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794406337,
      "updated": 1794406346
    },
    {
      "id": "6af4778b0000000000f552b7",
      "text": "\t\t[アイコン後付け記法]で使うものだし、やっぱり左向きのほうがいいような",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794406283,
      "updated": 1794406315
    },
    {
      "id": "6af4778b0000000000f552b8",
      "text": "\t\t 両方作ろう [suto3.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794406283,
      "updated": 1794406283
    },
    {
      "id": "6af4778b0000000000f552b9",
      "text": "\t\t  [https://api.iconify.design/clarity/thumbs-up-solid.svg?width=128&flip=horizontal&color=gold]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794406283,
      "updated": 1794406283
    },
    {
      "id": "6af4778b0000000000f552ba",
      "text": "\t\t  `&flip=horizontal`で左右反転だって",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794406283,
      "updated": 1794406283
    },
    {
      "id": "6af4778b0000000000f552bb",
      "text": "\t\t  なるほど…！[Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794406283,
      "updated": 1794406283
    },
    {
      "id": "6af4778b0000000000f552bc",
      "text": "   [https://api.iconify.design/noto/thumbs-up.svg?width=128&flip=horizontal][Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794406283,
      "updated": 1794406283
    },
    {
      "id": "6af4778b0000000000f552bd",
      "text": "   \tえ…あれ…？",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794406283,
      "updated": 1794406283
    },
    {
      "id": "6af4778b0000000000f552be",
      "text": "   \t\t絵文字によって対応状況が違うんだろうか…",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794406283,
      "updated": 1794406283
    },
    {
      "id": "6af4778b0000000000f552bf",
      "text": "   \t\tあ、ほんとだ。rotateもできない [suto3.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794406283,
      "updated": 1794406283
    },
    {
      "id": "6af4778b0000000000f552c0",
      "text": "\tよし作った[Nrem.icon] 2026-11-11",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794406283,
      "updated": 1794406450
    },
    {
      "id": "6af4778b0000000000f552c1",
      "text": "\t\t[👍いいね（右向き）] ([👍いいね（右向き）.icon])",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794406283,
      "updated": 1794406453
    },
    {
      "id": "6af4778b0000000000f552c2",
      "text": "\t\tNoto Color Emoji の [https://api.iconify.design/noto/thumbs-up.svg?width=18] の方が握った指の部分が分かりやすいと思ったので右向きはそれにしました",
